e men whom they met were `Uwaim bin Sa`idah and Ma`n bin `Adiyy. Ibn Shihab said. Sa`eed bin al-Musayyab told me that the one who said, I am the post on which the camel with a skin disease scratches itself and I am like a high class palm tree, was al-lubab bin al-Mundhir.";Musnad Ahmad 391, Book 3, Hadith 1;Sahih (Darussalam) [ al-Bukhari (2462) and Muslim (1691).(Darussalam);question #6;What was the significance of the verse of stoning in the context of early Islamic jurisprudence?
